    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/799500/extras/83756ac460a882eed618cfc43c06c983.avif?t=1731172274\" /></div><br><br><strong> A virus ravaged the planet, and you are one of the last survivors! Alone or in groups you will have to survive in a hostile world populated by living dead!<br>Find weapons, hunt for food, go to the cities to refuel, find a car, get resources and build your base!<br>But be careful zombies may not be the biggest threat to you ... </strong><br><br>In <strong> SurvivalZ </strong>, you can also fight with friends in the PVP arena or have fun in the Sandbox world!<br><br><strong> Happy hunting! </strong><br><br><br><strong> Features: </strong><br><br>\u25ba Cubic open world!<br>\u25ba No less than 15 different weapons!<br>\u25ba Choice of 5 characters!<br>\u25ba 3 different maps!<br>\u25ba Single or multiplayer mode!<br>\u25ba Different type of enemies!<br>\u25ba Building system!<br>\u25ba Day / night cycle!<br>\u25ba Craft system!<br>\u25ba Water and food system!<br>\u25ba Several vehicles!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/799500/extras/a9c02b9f4bf62f743cd04eda9fc15679.webp?t=1731172274\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/799500/extras/83756ac460a882eed618cfc43c06c983.avif?t=1731172274\" /></div><br><br><strong> A virus ravaged the planet, and you are one of the last survivors! Alone or in groups you will have to survive in a hostile world populated by living dead!<br>Find weapons, hunt for food, go to the cities to refuel, find a car, get resources and build your base!<br>But be careful zombies may not be the biggest threat to you ... </strong><br><br>In <strong> SurvivalZ </strong>, you can also fight with friends in the PVP arena or have fun in the Sandbox world!<br><br><strong> Happy hunting! </strong><br><br><br><strong> Features: </strong><br><br>\u25ba Cubic open world!<br>\u25ba No less than 15 different weapons!<br>\u25ba Choice of 5 characters!<br>\u25ba 3 different maps!<br>\u25ba Single or multiplayer mode!<br>\u25ba Different type of enemies!<br>\u25ba Building system!<br>\u25ba Day / night cycle!<br>\u25ba Craft system!<br>\u25ba Water and food system!<br>\u25ba Several vehicles!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/799500/extras/a9c02b9f4bf62f743cd04eda9fc15679.webp?t=1731172274\" /></div>",
